<title>POLAND: ZASADA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZASADA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.41 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.58 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.68 vs   3.85</p>
<p> Sales		   40.74 vs  40.96</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.44 vs   9.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.93 vs  14.16</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.77 vs  30.19</p>
<p> Sales		  324.28 vs 256.18</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish automotive group is Sobieslaw</p>
<p>Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
